Specifically:

  catalogs/basic/catalog.json
  catalogs/basic/rules.txt
      Vendored verbatim from google/a2ui `specification/v0_9_1/catalogs/basic`.

  packages/express/
      A TypeScript port of the A2UI Express lexer, parser, compiler and
      decompiler from google/a2ui
      `agent_sdks/python/a2ui_agent/src/a2ui/inference_formats/experimental/express`,
      and of the lexical rules in
      `specification/inference_formats/express/Express.g4`. Behavioural
      equivalence is asserted by the parity suite in
      `packages/express/test/parity.test.ts`, whose golden files are produced by
      the reference implementation.

The skill generator that used to be listed here was a port of
`CatalogSchemaHelper` and `ExpressPromptGenerator`. It has been deleted: the
build now calls the published `a2ui-agent-sdk` directly, so there is nothing
left to port. `scripts/build_skills.py` and `scripts/build_examples.py` use the
SDK, and `tools/tests/test_sdk_parity.py` asserts that what ships matches what
the reference produces.

